e=√(36+64)=10.","hint":"Differences are 6 and 8, so distance=√(36+64)=10."},"difficulty":2,"sequence_priority":2},{"id":"ac9m9a03-t-011","curriculum_code":"AC9M9A03","year_level":"Year 9","subject":"math","bank":"test","skill":"perpendicular_lines","question":"A line has equation y = -1/3 x + 4. What is the gradient of a perpendicular line?","audio_prompt":"A line has equation y = -1/3 x + 4. What is the gradient of a perpendicular line?","visual":{"type":"none","alt_text":""},"answers":[{"text":"3","is_correct":true},{"text":"-3","is_correct":false},{"text":"1/3","is_correct":false},{"text":"-1/3","is_correct":false}],"correct_index":0,"explanation":{"summary":"The negative reciprocal of -1/3 is 3.","hint":"The negative reciprocal of -1/3 is 3."},"difficulty":2,"sequence_priority":2},{"id":"ac9m9a03-t-012","curriculum_code":"AC9M9A03","year_level":"Year 9","subject":"math","bank":"test","skill":"line_equation","question":"Which equation passes through (0,-2) and (4,6)?","audio_prompt":"Which equation passes through (0,-2) and (4,6)?","visual":{"type":"none","alt_text":""},"answers":[{"text":"y = 2x - 2","is_correct":true},{"text":"y = 2x + 2","is_correct":false},{"text":"y = -2x - 2","is_correct":false},{"text":"y = x - 2","is_correct":false}],"correct_index":0,"explanation":{"summary":"Gradient=(6+2)/4=2 and y-intercept=-2.","hint":"Gradient=(6+2)/4=2 and y-intercept=-2."},"difficulty":2,"sequence_priority":2},{"id":"ac9m9a03-t-013","curriculum_code":"AC9M9A03","year_level":"Year 9","subject":"math","bank":"test","skill":"midpoint","question":"The midpoint of A(2,5) and B(x,9) is (6,7). Find x.","audio_prompt":"The midpoint of A(2,5) and B(x,9) is (6,7). Find x.","visual":{"type":"none","alt_text":""},"answers":[{"text":"10","is_correct":true},{"text":"8","is_correct":false},{"text":"6","is_correct":false},{"text":"14","is_correct":false}],"correct_index":0,"explanation":{"summary":"(2+x)/2=6, so x=10.","hint":"(2+x)/2=6, so x=10."},"difficulty":3,"sequence_priori